data: {"messages":[{"content":"请测试 `video-search` skill 的 Agent 真链路。\n\n必须严格执行：\n1. 先调用 read_file 读取 `/mnt/skills/custom/video-search/SKILL.md`。\n2. 再调用 bash 执行下面这段命令，不要改路径，不要省略任何输出文件。\n3. 执行完成后读取 `/mnt/user-data/outputs/video-search/result.json`，并在最终回复中返回这个 JSON 的内容和简短结论。\n\n```bash\nmkdir -p /mnt/user-data/outputs/video-search\npython /mnt/skills/custom/video-search/scripts/run.py --query Trafic --camera-id CAM_DEERFLOW_001 --labels person,car,bus,truck,motorcycle,bicycle --top-k 5 --index citybrain-video-library --config /mnt/skills/custom/configs/deerflow_config.json --output /mnt/user-data/outputs/video-search/result.json\n```\n\n成功判定：必须能看到 read_file 读取该 SKILL.md、bash 执行该 skill 入口、并生成 `/mnt/user-data/outputs/video-search/result.json`。","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":null,"id":"31a1e429-bab1-4dfe-ac68-76bee4c7e1cc"},{"content":"我将严格执行测试流程。\n\n","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":91,"prompt_tokens":9479,"total_tokens":9570,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":29,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":91},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,"text_tokens":9479}},"model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3.5-plus","system_fingerprint":null,"id":"chatcmpl-a0173e3d-90e2-9561-95e0-644963c70bef","finish_reason":"tool_calls","logprobs":null},"type":"ai","name":null,"id":"lc_run--019e8269-4c6f-79a1-8f68-383954dcf7dc-0","tool_calls":[{"name":"read_file","args":{"description":"读取 video-search skill 文档","path":"/mnt/skills/custom/video-search/SKILL.md"},"id":"call_9f5c828b873d44f5b142db59","type":"tool_call"}],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"input_tokens":9479,"output_tokens":91,"total_tokens":9570,"input_token_details":{},"output_token_details":{"reasoning":29}}},{"content":"---\nname: video-search\ndescription: Search indexed monitoring videos in Elasticsearch by keyword, camera, time range, object labels, event type, location, and optional precomputed query vectors, including StreetModel video-vector fields. Use after videos have been ingested into the video library.\n---\n\n# Video Search\n\n## Execution Priority\n\nPrioritize calling this skill's `scripts/run.py` entrypoint first. Only write custom code after the script result is unsuitable or the script cannot cover the requested task.\n\n## Input Resolution\n\nUse structured filters when the user names a camera, time window, object class, event type, or video id. Use `--query` for natural-language or keyword search. Use `--embedding-provider streetmodel` when the query should be embedded by `Qwen3-VL-Embedding-2B` directly. Use `--query-vector-json` only when the user provides a precomputed vector. Use `--vector-field` for a non-default dense vector field such as `video_vector-Qwen3-VL-Embedding-2B_urban_governance`.\n\n## Atomic CLI\n\n```bash\npython video-search/scripts/run.py --query \"person near gate\" --camera-id CAM_DEERFLOW_001 --top-k 10 --index huangxiao-video-library-vector-v1 --query-vector-json <query-vector.json> --config <config.json> --output <result.json>\n```\n\nStreetModel text-to-video semantic retrieval:\n\n```bash\npython video-search/scripts/run.py --query \"夜晚路口有很多车辆经过\" --index huangxiao-video-library-vector-v1 --embedding-provider streetmodel --vector-query-mode semantic --config <config.json> --output <result.json>\n```\n\nParameters: `--query`, `--index`, `--camera-id`, `--start-time`, `--end-time`, `--labels`, `--event-type`, `--query-vector-json`, `--embedding-provider`, `--embedding-model`, `--base-url`, `--dimensions`, `--timeout-seconds`, `--vector-field`, `--vector-query-mode`, `--top-k`, `--config`, `--output`.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Connect to Elasticsearch using `ES_URL`, `ES_USERNAME`, and `ES_PASSWORD` or explicit config fallback.\n2. Build bool filters for camera, time, labels, and event type.\n3. Use keyword search over `content_text`, `filename`, location fields, and metadata.\n4. If `--embedding-provider streetmodel` is set and no `--query-vector-json` is provided, call StreetModel `/embed` with `items[].type=text` to create the query vector.\n5. If a query vector is available and the index has the configured vector field, use vector scoring. If that field is unavailable, fall back to the legacy `vector` field when present.\n6. Use `--vector-query-mode semantic` for pure vector retrieval over filters only, or `hybrid` to combine keyword matching and vector scoring.\n5. Return compact hits with scores and source metadata.\n\n## Outputs\n\nReturns `hits`, `total`, `query_mode`, and `index`.\n\n## Failure Modes\n\n- `ES_CONNECTION_FAILED`\n- `ES_REQUEST_FAILED`\n- `INDEX_NOT_FOUND`\n\n## Constraints\n\nThis skill retrieves indexed video records. It does not ingest videos, run object detection, infer events, or generate evidence packages.\n","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"tool","name":"read_file","id":"53e237fd-441e-4c4b-91f7-fde717f935a6","tool_call_id":"call_9f5c828b873d44f5b142db59","artifact":null,"status":"success"},{"content":"现在执行测试命令：\n\n","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":141,"prompt_tokens":10269,"total_tokens":10410,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":0,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":141},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,"text_tokens":10269}},"model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3.5-plus","system_fingerprint":null,"id":"chatcmpl-d171221c-aa50-94e0-b1fe-7babad4fe5d4","finish_reason":"tool_calls","logprobs":null},"type":"ai","name":null,"id":"lc_run--019e8269-6e73-7692-8352-7aeba2793d65-0","tool_calls":[{"name":"bash","args":{"description":"执行 video-search skill 测试命令","command":"mkdir -p /mnt/user-data/outputs/video-search\npython /mnt/skills/custom/video-search/scripts/run.py --query